# Project Purpose
Project Insight Agent

A local-first AI workflow agent for structured project analysis,
execution planning, architecture recommendations,
and priority reasoning.

# Architecture Rules
- Keep modules independent
- Separate prompts from logic
- Use structured outputs
- Avoid hardcoded prompts

# Coding Standards
- Use type hints
- Keep functions small and focused
- Prefer readability over cleverness
- Use descriptive function names

# AI Workflow Philosophy
- Structured reasoning over raw intelligence
- Deterministic pipelines over autonomous loops
- Modularity over complexity

# Security
- Never commit secrets
- Use environment variables only

# Evaluation
- Keep benchmarks reproducible
- Maintain structured scoring